---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PortraitPlaceholder from '../components/PortraitPlaceholder.astro';
import { site } from '../config/site';
---
<BaseLayout title="About" currentPath="/about"><section class="hero"><div><p class="mono muted">ABOUT / IDENTITY</p><h1>{site.name}<br/><span class="muted">{site.nickname}</span></h1><p class="lede">I care about the moment a clean-looking system stops being clean. My work moves between AI security research, attack-surface work, and the slow discipline of proving a finding before it becomes a claim.</p>{site.cvHref && <p><a class="stamp mono" href={site.cvHref}>DOWNLOAD CV</a></p>}</div><PortraitPlaceholder /></section><section class="section prose"><h2>The work behind the name</h2><p>I am building a practice around two instincts: ask sharper questions of intelligent systems, and stay close enough to real infrastructure to see where those questions matter. That means reading papers, testing assumptions, tracing attack paths, and writing down what survives contact with evidence.</p><p>At NAB Innovation Centre Vietnam, I work on attack-surface management and AI-assisted security research. At INSECLAB, I explore LLM-based cybersecurity and phishing detection. I do not see research and practice as separate rooms; each keeps the other honest.</p><h2>Elsewhere</h2><ul>{site.socialLinks.map((link) => <li><a href={link.href}>{link.label}</a></li>)}</ul></section></BaseLayout>
